    "step8_outcome_verification": {
      "primary_intent": "The user wanted the agent to use Xbox.com to pick any game specifically shown under the site\u2019s \u201cBest sellers\u201d section, open that game\u2019s product page, and report three concrete metadata fields from that page: publisher, developer, and release date. The user would be flexible about which best-selling game is chosen, but not flexible about missing/incorrect metadata or choosing a game not actually shown as a best seller.",
